<title>FRANCE: Thomson-CSF/Dasa arms unit wins S.African deal.</title>
<headline>Thomson-CSF/Dasa arms unit wins S.African deal.</headline>
<dateline>LE BOURGET, France 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The TDA/FZ arms joint venture between Thomson-CSF and Daimler-Benz Aerospace (Dasa) has won a contract to supply 2.75-inch rockets for the Rooivalk South African attack helicopter.</p>
<p>TDA/FZ gave no price details in its statement, released at the Paris air show. Denel Aviation makes the Rooivalk aircraft.</p>
